cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this formalization by its version DOI once assigned, or by the
  immutable release commit.
title: "Global Stafford for rings of differential operators: Lean 4 formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Albert
    given-names: Christopher
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4773-416X"
    affiliation: "Graz University of Technology"
version: v1.0.4
date-released: "2026-09-09"
repository-code: "https://github.com/itpplasma/global-stafford-formal"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the same-divisor
  identity 1 = dR + FdS in the ring of finite-order differential operators
  of every smooth integral affine variety over a characteristic-zero field,
  extending the formalized Weyl-algebra case (Stafford's Conjecture 3.8).
keywords:
  - Lean
  - Mathlib
  - differential operators
  - Stafford's conjecture
  - D-modules
  - formal mathematics
